{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"23":"The Book of Zakah"},"section_detail":{"23":{"hadithnumber_first":2435,"hadithnumber_last":2618,"arabicnumber_first":2435,"arabicnumber_last":2618,"name_native":"كتاب الزكاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2550,"arabicnumber":2550,"text":"اخبرنا محمد بن ادم، عن عبدة، عن هشام بن عروة، عن فاطمة، عن اسماء بنت ابي بكر، ان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قال لها \" لا تحصي فيحصي الله عز وجل عليك","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":23,"hadith":116}}]}